# Service & Repository Contract Rules

## Services (`src/domain/services/index.ts`)
- This file may contain ONLY:
  - interface definitions
  - type aliases
- It MAY import:
  - domain models
- It MUST NOT contain:
  - class implementations
  - logic
  - instantiation
  - imports from `src/services/impl` or `container.ts`

## Repositories (`src/repositories/index.ts`)
- This file may contain ONLY:
  - repository interfaces
- It MUST NOT:
  - import concrete implementations
  - import database clients
  - perform queries
